---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Rebuild the profile and summary of every contact with mail in the last --since days, backfilled mail included.

Background AI summarises a contact only once mail with them arrives live, never from the mail the first sync downloaded. This sends the older contacts' mail to your model, one call per contact whose summary is missing or stale. Run --dry-run first to see how many.

Usage: mxr relationships rebuild [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>


      --since <SINCE_DAYS>
          Window in days: contacts with mail in it are rebuilt

          [default: 30]

      --dry-run
          Count the contacts and model calls without writing or calling the model

      --format <FORMAT>
          [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
